{"unit_id":"Serenity-2026__dsh-treecom#card-zh","repo":"Serenity-2026/dsh-treecom","commit":"ff68707d6d9c3dbcfaa01831662c810586e4db8a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"TreeCom 是面向 DSH Web 的对话树插件，将普通会话及其分叉整理为可交互的树形视图。它通过会话视图、右侧边栏和标题栏入口接入 DSH，并按会话日志构建节点关系。用户可以查看轮次详情、从任意轮次创建分支、切换分支、管理标签，并按根会话分组浏览。适合需要追踪多条对话思路、比较不同回答路径或整理大量会话的 DSH 用户。插件使用 DSH 自带的会话服务，不需要额外 API 密钥；标签保存在本地 DSH 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-39","plugin.client.js:4135-4167"]}
{"unit_id":"Serenity-2026__dsh-treecom#card-en","repo":"Serenity-2026/dsh-treecom","commit":"ff68707d6d9c3dbcfaa01831662c810586e4db8a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"TreeCom is a DSH Web plugin that displays conversation forks as an interactive tree. Open it from the conversation view, right sidebar, or header. Inspect turns, fork from earlier turns, switch branches, and group related sessions. It uses DSH session services; labels are stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-39","plugin.client.js:4135-4167"]}
